    "description": "Iranian payment facilitators provide merchant-facing services around online payment gateways. ZarinPal's documentation illustrates how payment requests, hosted checkout, transaction verification, and financial reference numbers fit together.",
    "tags": ["Iran", "Financial Technology", "Payment Gateways", "Merchant Payments", "Payment Facilitators"],
    "status": null,
